{"kp_id": "zj-015.kp0001", "video_id": "zj-015", "type": "concept_definition", "statement": "顺经（顺气）扎针为补，逆经（逆气）为泻；此为迎随补泻之一。", "entity_ids": ["method.bu_xie"], "chapter_id": "zj-015.c01", "evidence_quote": "顺气扎针就叫做补好", "seg_from": 1, "seg_to": 2, "start_s": 1.93, "end_s": 12.17, "citation": {"youtube_id": "uVk3uAz6w0c", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uVk3uAz6w0c&t=1s", "series": "zj", "episode": 15, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 15", "start_s": 1.93, "end_s": 12.17}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "气杂=气扎", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-015.kp0002", "video_id": "zj-015", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "中府、云门接近常同用；书称中府为肺募，口述以云门为真肺募。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.lu1", "acupoint.lu2", "concept.mu_xue"], "chapter_id": "zj-015.c01", "evidence_quote": "实际上虞门才是真的肺的墓穴", "seg_from": 4, "seg_to": 11, "start_s": 23.12, "end_s": 78.695, "citation": {"youtube_id": "uVk3uAz6w0c", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uVk3uAz6w0c&t=23s", "series": "zj", "episode": 15, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 15", "start_s": 23.12, "end_s": 78.69}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "虞门=云门；木穴/墓穴=募穴", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-015.kp0003", "video_id": "zj-015", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "天府在臂内侧两肌之间（“拉小老鼠”处），可治外伤鼻血等；侠白在天府下一寸。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.lu3", "acupoint.lu4"], "chapter_id": "zj-015.c01", "evidence_quote": "一拉个小老鼠跑出来，那就天府穴", "seg_from": 23, "seg_to": 68, "start_s": 143.36, "end_s": 359.685, "citation": {"youtube_id": "uVk3uAz6w0c", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uVk3uAz6w0c&t=143s", "series": "zj", "episode": 15, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 15", "start_s": 143.36, "end_s": 359.69}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "天补=天府；瑕白=侠白", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-015.kp0004", "video_id": "zj-015", "type": "concept_definition", "statement": "五腧穴分布为手不过肘、足不过膝。", "entity_ids": ["new.concept.五腧穴"], "chapter_id": "zj-015.c01", "evidence_quote": "手，不过肘足不过膝就是我们的五腧穴", "seg_from": 71, "seg_to": 71, "start_s": 369.51, "end_s": 372.005, "citation": {"youtube_id": "uVk3uAz6w0c", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uVk3uAz6w0c&t=369s", "series": "zj", "episode": 15, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 15", "start_s": 369.51, "end_s": 372.0}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-015.kp0005", "video_id": "zj-015", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "病人平卧时直刺可不论补泻；针尖逆经为泻、顺经为补。", "entity_ids": ["method.bu_xie"], "chapter_id": "zj-015.c01", "evidence_quote": "逆向下呢，就是泻，如果是同向下呢，就是补", "seg_from": 92, "seg_to": 93, "start_s": 457.36, "end_s": 468.22, "citation": {"youtube_id": "uVk3uAz6w0c", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uVk3uAz6w0c&t=457s", "series": "zj", "episode": 15, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 15", "start_s": 457.36, "end_s": 468.22}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-015.kp0006", "video_id": "zj-015", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "肺虚久咳可取太渊；穴在寸口动脉处，针时须以指甲拨开动脉。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.lu9", "disease.ke_sou"], "chapter_id": "zj-015.c02", "evidence_quote": "久咳尾虚", "seg_from": 205, "seg_to": 337, "start_s": 1033.16, "end_s": 1754.999, "citation": {"youtube_id": "uVk3uAz6w0c", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uVk3uAz6w0c&t=1033s", "series": "zj", "episode": 15, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 15", "start_s": 1033.16, "end_s": 1755.0}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "元泻/太原=太渊；尾虚=为虚", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-015.kp0007", "video_id": "zj-015", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "列缺为手太阴络穴，通任脉；任脉病及自咽喉至前阴诸症可取列缺。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.lu7", "meridian.cv", "concept.luo_xue"], "chapter_id": "zj-015.c02", "evidence_quote": "任脉的病我们下可以下列缺", "seg_from": 234, "seg_to": 254, "start_s": 1228.634, "end_s": 1353.519, "citation": {"youtube_id": "uVk3uAz6w0c", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uVk3uAz6w0c&t=1228s", "series": "zj", "episode": 15, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 15", "start_s": 1228.63, "end_s": 1353.52}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "落穴=络穴；费心=肺经", "source": "llm_read"}
